# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# references/ — read-only clones and the Survival symlink (docs/plan/03).
# Nothing under references/ is our source. The directory itself, its README and its opt-out
# barrier files are tracked; everything cloned into it is not.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
references/*
!references/.gitkeep
!references/README.md
!references/.editorconfig
!references/Directory.Build.props
!references/Directory.Build.targets
!references/Directory.Packages.props

