# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Aspire local development — ADR-014
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# The kubeconfig k3s writes into its bind-mounted /output. It is regenerated on every `dotnet run`
# of CyberCloud.AppHost and carries that run's client certificate, so it is worthless the moment
# the container stops and is a credential while it is alive.
src/Hosts/CyberCloud.AppHost/.k3s/
